00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.568 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-These are our favorite

00:00:01.568 --> 00:00:02.235 size:75% position:38% line:92%
"Jokes of the Week."

00:00:02.235 --> 00:00:03.870 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Cheering, whistling,
and applause ]

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:05.005 size:78% position:39% line:92%
According to sources,

00:00:05.005 --> 00:00:08.074
former National Security Advisor
John Bolton

00:00:08.074 --> 00:00:09.275 size:88% position:44% line:92%
told conservative donors

00:00:09.275 --> 00:00:12.379 align:start size:94% position:6%
he thinks President Trump
is mentally unstable,

00:00:12.379 --> 00:00:15.582
but I'm sure Trump
will clear up that misconception

00:00:15.582 --> 00:00:18.685 line:92%
with 150 tweets at 3:00 am

00:00:18.685 --> 00:00:19.285 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:19.285 --> 00:00:20.587 align:start size:94% position:6%
Senator Mitt Romney
was seen today

00:00:20.587 --> 00:00:24.157 align:start size:94% position:6%
drinking chocolate milk
during the impeachment trial

00:00:24.157 --> 00:00:25.458 size:81% position:41% line:92%
and then, right after,

00:00:25.458 --> 00:00:27.494 line:92%
he failed a breathalyzer test.

00:00:27.494 --> 00:00:28.595 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:28.595 --> 00:00:31.364 align:start size:94% position:6%
State lawmakers in Kentuck
have proposed a bill

00:00:31.364 --> 00:00:32.465 line:92%
that would require schools

00:00:32.465 --> 00:00:34.968 align:start size:94% position:6%
to start teaching sex ed
in kindergarten.

00:00:34.968 --> 00:00:36.970 align:start size:94% position:6%
Said a Kentucky first grader
"Oh, man,

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:38.338 align:start size:94% position:6%
that really would've
been helpful

00:00:38.338 --> 00:00:39.706 line:92%
before my wedding night!"

00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:40.573 size:78% position:39% line:92%
[ Laughter and ohhs ]

00:00:40.573 --> 00:00:41.608 line:92%
Republican Senator Mike Brau

00:00:41.608 --> 00:00:44.110 align:start size:94% position:6%
this weekend said that he hope
impeachment will serve

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:47.113 align:start size:94% position:6%
as a learning experience
for President Trump, saying,

00:00:47.113 --> 00:00:49.616 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I think he'll
put 2 and 2 together."

00:00:49.616 --> 00:00:50.884 align:start size:94% position:6%
Because if there's
one thing we know

00:00:50.884 --> 00:00:53.787 align:start size:94% position:6%
about a man who has
bankrupted three casinos,

00:00:53.787 --> 00:00:55.422 line:92%
it's that he's good at math.

00:00:55.422 --> 00:00:56.122 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:56.122 --> 00:00:58.558 align:start size:94% position:6%
A New York woman has admitte
that she is responsible

00:00:58.558 --> 00:01:01.294 align:start size:94% position:6%
for sending her boyfriend
to the emergency room

00:01:01.294 --> 00:01:02.128 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
24 times last year

00:01:02.128 --> 00:01:05.165 align:start size:94% position:6%
by secretly putting pesticides
in his food.

00:01:05.165 --> 00:01:09.436
When he asked the doctor wha
to take for that, she said

00:01:09.436 --> 00:01:10.537 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"The hint."

00:01:10.537 --> 00:01:11.704 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.704 --> 00:01:14.340 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:18.445 line:92%
